Language Hangman Desktop
========================

What this licence covers
------------------------

The MIT licence below covers this project's own software and content: the Python source,
build and packaging scripts, tests and documentation in this repository, the word lists in
src/desktop/content/levels/ and the application icon in assets/.

It does not cover:

- The legacy word banks in data/words/, from the earlier browser prototype. Their authorship
  is still being confirmed and no licence has been chosen for them yet (decision DEC-08 in
  docs/DELIVERY.md). They are not in the installer.
- Third-party components distributed with the Windows installer, which keep their own
  licences. They are listed in packaging/third-party/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt and installed
  next to the program.


